 girl from the Dark May Project.","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":2,"absoluteEpisode":2},{"id":"kitsu:49564:3","title":"Choubi Hanano - The Fifth","released":"2026-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt41295083/1/3/w780.jpg","overview":"Choubi Hanano joins ITEM as they investigate an underground fighting ring.","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":3,"absoluteEpisode":3},{"id":"kitsu:49564:4","title":"Mitori Kouzaku - Liquid Shadow","released":"2026-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt41295083/1/4/w780.jpg","overview":"ITEM battles a girl who can make dolls and weapons from liquid metal.","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":4,"absoluteEpisode":4},{"id":"kitsu:49564:5","title":"Infiltration","released":"2026-11-06T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt41295083/1/5/w780.jpg","overview":"Hanano infiltrates a secure building to get the information ITEM needs.","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":5,"absoluteEpisode":5},{"id":"kitsu:49564:6","title":"Colosseum","released":"2026-11-13T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt41295083/1/6/w780.jpg","overview":"ITEM tracks down their quarry to an empty library where a fighting tournament is held.","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":6,"absoluteEpisode":6},{"id":"kitsu:49564:7","title":"ITEM vs. ITEM","released":"2026-11-20T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt41295083/1/7/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":7,"absoluteEpisode":7},{"id":"kitsu:49564:8","title":"Episode 8","released":"2026-11-27T00:00:00.000Z","season":1,"episode":8,"thumbnail":"https://episodes.metahub.space/tt41295083/1/8/w780.jpg","overview":"","imdb_id":"tt41295083","imdbSeason":1,"imdbEpisode":8,"a